— Restaurant thaï &amp; fast food thaï à Pontault-Combault\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:type\" content=\"image/png\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\"/><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\"/><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"/><script>document.documentElement.classList.add('js')</script><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,500&amp;family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&amp;family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"noise\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main class=\"min-h-screen bg-th-950 text-cream-50 noise\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 py-16\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-cream-50/50 hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors mb-8\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-left-linear\" class=\"text-base\"></iconify-icon>Retour à l&#x27;accueil</a><h1 class=\"font-serif text-3xl text-cream-50 mb-6\">Informations allergènes</h1><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 bg-white/[0.04] border border-gold-400/20 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 mb-8\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:info-circle-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-gold-400 mt-0.5\"></iconify-icon><p class=\"text-sm text-cream-50/70 font-light leading-relaxed\">Nos plats peuvent contenir l&#x27;un des 14 allergènes majeurs listés ci-dessous (règlement UE n° 1169/2011). Le détail précis par plat est tenu à votre disposition : demandez-le à notre équipe au restaurant ou précisez votre allergie lors de la commande en ligne.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-xl px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gold-400/10 text-gold-400 text-sm font-medium ring-1 ring-gold-400/20 shrink-0\">1</span><div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-cream-50\">Gluten</div><div class=\"text-xs text-cream-50/45 font-light leading-relaxed mt-0.5\">Céréales contenant du gluten (blé, seigle, orge, avoine, épeautre, kamut). Présent dans les nouilles, sauces au soja, desserts.</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-xl px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gold-400/10 text-gold-400 text-sm font-medium ring-1 ring-gold-400/20 shrink-0\">2</span><div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-cream-50\">Crustacés</div><div class=\"text-xs text-cream-50/45 font-light leading-relaxed mt-0.5\">Crevettes, crabes et autres crustacés.</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-xl px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gold-400/10 text-gold-400 text-sm font-medium ring-1 ring-gold-400/20 shrink-0\">3</span><div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-cream-50\">Œufs</div><div class=\"text-xs text-cream-50/45 font-light leading-relaxed mt-0.5\">Présents dans certaines marinades, beignets et sauces.</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-xl px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gold-400/10 text-gold-400 text-sm font-medium ring-1 ring-gold-400/20 shrink-0\">4</span><div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-cream-50\">Poissons</div><div class=\"text-xs text-cream-50/45 font-light leading-relaxed mt-0.5\">Notamment dans les bouillons et certaines préparations (ex. sauce nuoc-mâm). </div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-xl px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gold-400/10 text-gold-400 text-sm font-medium ring-1 ring-gold-400/20 shrink-0\">5</span><div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-cream-50\">Arachides</div><div class=\"text-xs text-cream-50/45 font-light leading-relaxed mt-0.5\">Cacahuètes et dérivés, fréquentes dans la cuisine thaïlandaise.</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-xl px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gold-400/10 text-gold-400 text-sm font-medium ring-1 ring-gold-400/20 shrink-0\">6</span><div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-cream-50\">Soja</div><div class=\"text-xs text-cream-50/45 font-light leading-relaxed mt-0.5\">Sauce soja et dérivés.</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-xl px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gold-400/10 text-gold-400 text-sm font-medium ring-1 ring-gold-400/20 shrink-0\">7</span><div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-cream-50\">Lait</div><div class=\"text-xs text-cream-50/45 font-light leading-relaxed mt-0.5\">Lait et produits laitiers, y compris lactose.</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-xl px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gold-400/10 text-gold-400 text-sm font-medium ring-1 ring-gold-400/20 shrink-0\">8</span><div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-cream-50\">Fruits à coque</div><div class=\"text-xs text-cream-50/45 font-light leading-relaxed mt-0.5\">Amandes, noisettes, noix de cajou, noix, etc.</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-xl px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gold-400/10 text-gold-400 text-sm font-medium ring-1 ring-gold-400/20 shrink-0\">9</span><div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-cream-50\">Céleri</div><div class=\"text-xs text-cream-50/45 font-light leading-relaxed mt-0.5\">Céleri et produits dérivés.</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-xl px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gold-400/10 text-gold-400 text-sm font-medium ring-1 ring-gold-400/20 shrink-0\">10</span><div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-cream-50\">Moutarde</div><div class=\"text-xs text-cream-50/45 font-light leading-relaxed mt-0.5\">Graines de moutarde et dérivés.</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-xl px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gold-400/10 text-gold-400 text-sm font-medium ring-1 ring-gold-400/20 shrink-0\">11</span><div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-cream-50\">Graines de sésame</div><div class=\"text-xs text-cream-50/45 font-light leading-relaxed mt-0.5\">Sésame et huile de sésame.</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-xl px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gold-400/10 text-gold-400 text-sm font-medium ring-1 ring-gold-400/20 shrink-0\">12</span><div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-cream-50\">Anhydride sulfureux / sulfites</div><div class=\"text-xs text-cream-50/45 font-light leading-relaxed mt-0.5\">Présents dans certains condiments et vinaigres.</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-xl px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gold-400/10 text-gold-400 text-sm font-medium ring-1 ring-gold-400/20 shrink-0\">13</span><div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-cream-50\">Lupin</div><div class=\"text-xs text-cream-50/45 font-light leading-relaxed mt-0.5\">Farine ou graines de lupin.</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-xl px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gold-400/10 text-gold-400 text-sm font-medium ring-1 ring-gold-400/20 shrink-0\">14</span><div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-cream-50\">Mollusques</div><div class=\"text-xs text-cream-50/45 font-light leading-relaxed mt-0.5\">Moules, palourdes et autres mollusques.</div></div></div></div><p class=\"text-xs text-cream-50/35 font-light leading-relaxed mt-8\">Malgré toutes les précautions prises en cuisine, nous ne pouvons garantir l&#x27;absence totale de traces. En cas d&#x27;allergie grave, merci de nous en informer avant de commander.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/09lgyggnhjlha.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3jv2ehrx-n-jl.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3jv2ehrx-n-jl.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n16:I[68027,[],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/4200qnwcjk7ra.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,500\\u0026family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600\\u0026family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600\\u0026display=swap\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n14:X\\n0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"allergenes\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"allergenes\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4624],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/4200qnwcjk7